What:		/proc/oplus_locking/thread_info_ctrl
Description:
		Controls donor locking thread-information reporting.  The Android 14
		OnePlus 9R implementation defaults this diagnostic control to zero.

What:		/proc/oplus_locking/lock_stats/{mutex,rwsem_read,rwsem_write,futex_art}
Description:
		Per-lock-class wait statistics published by the OnePlus locking
		monitor selected in the 9R Kona production configuration.

What:		/proc/oplus_locking/{kern_lock_stats,kern_lock_stats_rclear,fatal_lock_stats,lock_thres_ctrl}
Description:
		Aggregate lock statistics, read-and-clear statistics, fatal lock
		statistics, and threshold control from the donor locking monitor.

What:		/sys/module/oplus_locking_strategy/parameters/*
Description:
		Donor controls and counters for mutex, rwsem, ART futex, and
		optimistic-spin locking policy.  The production 9R configuration
		exposes 13 parameters.  locking_enable defaults to mutex, rwsem,
		futex, and OSQ enabled.

Notes:
		/proc/oplus_locking/top_lock_stats is intentionally absent because
		CONFIG_OPLUS_INTERNAL_VERSION is not selected by the 9R Kona
		production configuration.
